./build.sh resources reconstructs the dlmalloc/, libc-bottom-half/ and
libc-top-half/ directories from the wasi-sdk-20 commit pinned in dlmalloc.lock.json.
The archive and every selected file are SHA-256 checked against that lock and
tools/resources/wasi.files. The directories are generated, not tracked; releases
still bundle them. uname.c and valloc.c are local compatibility code and stay tracked.

close.c is the upstream C replacement for a function Zig 0.17.1 implements in
lib/c/unistd.zig (Nuxi BSD-2-Clause; see LICENSE-cloudlibc). cosh.c/coshf.c are musl
sources (see COPYRIGHT-musl); dlmalloc licensing is described in LICENSE.
